flowchart TD
    FEATURE["camera feature opened"] --> NEED{simple one-off capture?}
    NEED -->|yes| INTENT["system camera intent / Photo Picker - NO CAMERA permission (Ch 51)"]
    NEED -->|no, custom UI/analysis| PERM{CAMERA permission granted? Ch 51}
    PERM -->|denied| DEGRADE["rationale / settings / degrade (Ch 51)"]
    PERM -->|granted| BIND["CameraX: bind use cases to LifecycleOwner (Ch 44)"]
    BIND --> PREVIEW["Preview (viewfinder)"]
    BIND --> CAPTURE["ImageCapture / VideoCapture"]
    BIND --> ANALYSIS["ImageAnalysis (off-main, keep-latest)"]
    CAPTURE --> OUTPUT["output: app-internal / MediaStore (Ch 25/62)"]
    OUTPUT --> EXIF["orientation + strip location EXIF (Ch 28)"]
    ANALYSIS --> MLKIT["ML Kit barcode/text off-main"]
    STOP["feature closed / app background (Ch 44)"] -.->|lifecycle STOPPED -> release camera| BIND
